[tr_TR] "Recreate All Languages (Templates Only)" -> "T\u00fcm Dilleri Yeniden Olu\u015ftur (Yaln\u0131zca \u015eablonlar)"
[tr_TR] "Recreate All Languages (Template Parts Only)" -> "T\u00fcm Dilleri Yeniden Olu\u015ftur (Yaln\u0131zca \u015eablon Par\u00e7alar\u0131)"
[tr_TR] "Re-create all" -> "T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc yeniden olu\u015ftur"
[tr_TR] "Fix all navs" -> "T\u00fcm navigasyonlar\u0131 d\u00fczelt"
[tr_TR] "Translating a real post with this model\u2026" -> "Bu modelle ger\u00e7ek bir yaz\u0131 \u00e7eviriliyor\u2026"
[tr_TR] "preset" -> "\u00f6n ayar"
[tr_TR] "Recreating\u2026" -> "Yeniden olu\u015fturuluyor\u2026"
[tr_TR] "\u2713 All templates recreated." -> "\u2713 T\u00fcm \u015fablonlar yeniden olu\u015fturuldu."
[tr_TR] "Some templates could not be recreated." -> "Baz\u0131 \u015fablonlar yeniden olu\u015fturulamad\u0131."
[tr_TR] "This overwrites this template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?" -> "Bu \u015fablonu etkin temadan yeni bir kopyayla yazacak ve Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "This overwrites every template with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?" -> "Her \u015fablonu etkin temadan yeni bir kopyayla yazacak ve Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "\u2713 All parts recreated." -> "\u2713 T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar yeniden olu\u015fturuldu."
[tr_TR] "Some parts could not be recreated." -> "Baz\u0131 par\u00e7alar yeniden olu\u015fturulamad\u0131."
[tr_TR] "This overwrites this template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to it. This cannot be undone. Continue?" -> "Bu \u015fablon par\u00e7as\u0131n\u0131 etkin temadan yeni bir kopyayla yazacak ve Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "This overwrites every template part with a fresh copy from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?" -> "Her \u015fablon par\u00e7as\u0131n\u0131 etkin temadan yeni bir kopyayla yazacak ve Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "Re-create all templates" -> "T\u00fcm \u015fablonlar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur"
[tr_TR] "Re-create all parts" -> "T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur"
[tr_TR] "This runs Re-create all templates, Re-create all parts, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing templates and parts with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customisations) and re-translates content \u2014 none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template and part, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?" -> "Bu, {total} etkin dillerinizin her biri i\u00e7in birer birer \"T\u00fcm \u015fablonlar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur\", \"T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur\", \"T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc \u00e7evir\", \"T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131 d\u00fczelt\" ve \"T\u00fcm ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 d\u00fczelt\" i\u015flemlerini \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Mevcut \u015fablonlar\u0131 ve par\u00e7alar\u0131 etkin temadan yeni kopyalarla yazacak (Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek) ve i\u00e7eri\u011fi yeniden \u00e7evirecek \u2014 bunlar\u0131n hi\u00e7biri geri al\u0131namaz. \"T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc \u00e7evir\" her \u015fablon ve par\u00e7a i\u00e7in ger\u00e7ek AI API \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131 yapacak, bu uzun s\u00fcrebilir ve sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131n\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak \u00fccret gerektirebilir. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "This runs Re-create all templates, Translate all, Fix all parts, and Fix all links for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time \u2014 template parts (headers, footers, etc.) are left untouched. It overwrites existing templates with fresh copies from the active theme (discarding Site Editor customisations) and re-translates content \u2014 none of this can be undone. Translate all makes real AI API calls for every template, which may take a while and may incur cost depending on your provider. Continue?" -> "Bu, {total} etkin dillerinizin her biri i\u00e7in birer birer \"T\u00fcm \u015fablonlar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur\", \"T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc \u00e7evir\", \"T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131 d\u00fczelt\" ve \"T\u00fcm ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 d\u00fczelt\" i\u015flemlerini \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r \u2014 \u015fablon par\u00e7alar\u0131 (ba\u015fl\u0131klar, altl\u0131klar vb.) de\u011fi\u015ftirilmez. Mevcut \u015fablonlar\u0131 etkin temadan yeni kopyalarla yazacak (Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek) ve i\u00e7eri\u011fi yeniden \u00e7evirecek \u2014 bunlar\u0131n hi\u00e7biri geri al\u0131namaz. \"T\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc \u00e7evir\" her \u015fablon i\u00e7in ger\u00e7ek AI API \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131 yapacak, bu uzun s\u00fcrebilir ve sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131n\u0131za ba\u011fl\u0131 olarak \u00fccret gerektirebilir. Devam edilsin mi?"
[tr_TR] "This runs Re-create all parts (headers, footers, and every other template part) for every one of your {total} active languages, one language at a time. It overwrites existing template parts with fresh copies from the active theme, discarding any Site Editor customisations made to them. This cannot be undone. Continue?" -> "Bu, {total} etkin dillerinizin her biri i\u00e7in birer birer \"T\u00fcm par\u00e7alar\u0131 yeniden olu\u015ftur\" (ba\u015fl\u0131klar, altl\u0131klar ve di\u011fer t\u00fcm \u015fablon par\u00e7alar\u0131) i\u015flemini \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Mevcut \u015fablon par\u00e7alar\u0131n\u0131 etkin temadan yeni kopyalarla yazacak ve Site Editor \u00f6zelle\u015ftirmelerini iptal edecek. Bu i\u015flem geri al\u0131namaz. Devam edilsin mi?"
